    "text": "Mass of the part hanging is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>M</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac></math>. Centre of mass of this part lies <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>L</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> distance from the surface.<br /><img alt=\"solution\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/1247348_1614039_ans_9ce4f6e86452422a9e13f364f139a899.PNG\" /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Work done in lifting the hanging part to surface is<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi>M</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi>L</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math>",
